{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0124_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "801ed82d67d5129c9b7f7c6dd5bcf5147187915bddb8bf96916301285391ad9c", "ja": "初めてこの衣装を着た時、ワタシたちって\nつながってるのカモ……って思ったんだヨー。", "zh": "因为在我第一次穿上这套服装时，\n我觉得……我们是紧紧相连的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
