{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cba0ef5a3e10ebb2119b83d80fea4e44a4cf73850f57e2b4bc0aea80279878b1", "ja": "ファンとの一体感というわけか……。\nけど、それならTシャツがなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "这算是追求跟粉丝的一体感吗……\n不过，既然是这样，那就算没有T恤也不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
